==Trivia==
*Although its description implies that this unit gets improved resistance to Metal enemies in its [[True Form]], the only stat that changes is its recharge time.
*Despite being JP-exclusive, it has localization for other regions, which probably meant that an International version of the collaboration was planned at some point, until eventually being scrapped.
*Droid Cat used to be between [[Reindeer Fish Cat (Rare Cat)|Reindeer Fish Cat]] and [[Adult Cat (Rare Cat)|Adult Cat]] instead of with the other [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collaboration Cats]] in [[Cat Guide]], Equip and [[Upgrade Menu]]s.

